      "writtenOn": "2021-12-22T00:39:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So no manual edits should be made to this file, and\nwith chromium:3343698, the name should be fixed anyway.\nI am not sure why you need the gpio-cells property here?",
      "revId": "8ad1438f1b8399ec67950c50dba7c91428b6bf47",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
