      "message": "The \"#gpio-cells\" property is considered a constant, so it should be part of the generated output, instead of requiring the user to add to the overlay.\n\nIt\u0027s unfortunate that we\u0027re not able to set the default to 0 in the named-gpios.yaml file, but this convention isn\u0027t supported by the DT compiler.",
